# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create, update, and use instances to run jobs with free or paid plans."
msgstr "Membuat, memperbarui, dan menggunakan instance untuk menjalankan job dengan paket gratis maupun berbayar."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and manage instances"
msgstr "Membuat dan mengelola instance"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and manage instances {#create-and-manage-instances}"
msgstr "Membuat dan mengelola instance {#create-and-manage-instances}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access to IBM Quantum Platform services is controlled by the **instances** to which you are assigned. Users can belong to multiple instances.\n"
msgstr "Akses ke layanan IBM Quantum Platform dikendalikan oleh **instance** yang kamu ikuti. Pengguna bisa terdaftar di beberapa instance sekaligus.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instances are virtual servers (deployments of IBM Quantum Compute Service) that manage the execution of your workloads, including executing quantum programs and classical compute tasks (such as processing error mitigation).  Instances are identified by their *Cloud Resource Name* (CRN). This CRN can be used when sending workloads from your Qiskit programs.\n"
msgstr "Instance adalah server virtual (deployment IBM Quantum Compute Service) yang mengelola eksekusi workload-mu, termasuk menjalankan program kuantum dan tugas komputasi klasik (seperti pemrosesan error mitigation).  Instance diidentifikasi melalui *Cloud Resource Name* (CRN)-nya. CRN ini bisa digunakan saat mengirim workload dari program Qiskit-mu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can see the instances you have access to on the dashboard, or by clicking the \"Instances\" tab from the dashboard. Each instance is listed with its CRN identifier.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa melihat instance yang bisa kamu akses di dashboard, atau dengan mengklik tab \"Instances\" dari dashboard. Setiap instance ditampilkan beserta pengenal CRN-nya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need a different instance for every service plan (such as Open or Pay-As-You-Go) you use in every region that you want to use. The account manager and anyone with enough permission can create an instance and define its configuration, such as its allocations, usage limits, quantum computers, and user permissions.\n"
msgstr "Kamu memerlukan instance yang berbeda untuk setiap paket layanan (seperti Open atau Pay-As-You-Go) yang kamu gunakan di setiap region yang ingin kamu pakai. Manajer akun dan siapa saja dengan izin yang cukup bisa membuat instance dan mendefinisikan konfigurasinya, seperti alokasi, batas penggunaan, komputer kuantum, dan izin pengguna.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum Platform [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) displays the instances to which you have access. Depending on your access, you can view full details, edit, and delete instances on the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"
msgstr "[Dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) IBM Quantum Platform menampilkan instance yang bisa kamu akses. Tergantung aksesmu, kamu bisa melihat detail lengkap, mengedit, dan menghapus instance di [halaman Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important that you understand which instance you are using, because all instances that are not associated with the Open Plan incur a cost (or count toward your plan's alloted time).\n"
msgstr "Penting untuk memahami instance mana yang kamu gunakan, karena semua instance yang tidak terkait dengan Open Plan akan dikenakan biaya (atau dihitung terhadap waktu yang dialokasikan untuk paketmu).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The jobs you run and the jobs run by other collaborators in the same instance count toward the reported usage for that instance. \n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Job yang kamu jalankan dan job yang dijalankan oleh kolaborator lain di instance yang sama akan dihitung dalam penggunaan yang dilaporkan untuk instance tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can view an instance's usage on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, or, for those with the proper authority, the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page.  Note that the pages might show different usage numbers because the Instance page shows total usage prior to the current timestamp, while the Analytics page uses full-day boundaries.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa melihat penggunaan instance di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), atau, bagi yang memiliki wewenang yang sesuai, di halaman [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics). Perlu diperhatikan bahwa kedua halaman tersebut mungkin menampilkan angka penggunaan yang berbeda karena halaman Instance menampilkan total penggunaan sebelum timestamp saat ini, sementara halaman Analytics menggunakan batas hari penuh.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"open-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"open-plan\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan instance {#open-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance Open Plan {#open-plan-instance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan users can run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free (up to 10 minutes per 28-day rolling window). The QPU usage can be tracked on the [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna Open Plan bisa menjalankan circuit kuantum di QPU terbaik di dunia secara gratis (hingga 10 menit per jendela bergulir 28 hari). Penggunaan QPU bisa dipantau di halaman [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) dan [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"standard-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"standard-plan\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance {#pay-as-you-go-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan-instance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pay-As-You-Go Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads sent to QPUs by using this plan incur a charge. Pay-as-you-go instances can have a total cost limit (optional).\n"
msgstr "Pay-As-You-Go Plan adalah paket berbayar. Untuk menggunakan paket ini, kamu harus membuat instance dan menugaskannya ke paket tersebut. Semua workload yang dikirim ke QPU menggunakan paket ini akan dikenakan biaya. Instance pay-as-you-go bisa memiliki batas biaya total (opsional).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"flex-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"flex-plan\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan instance {#flex-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance Flex Plan {#flex-plan-instance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Flex Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must first [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up. Then, create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads sent to QPUs by using this plan count toward your alloted subscription. \n"
msgstr "Flex Plan adalah paket berbayar. Untuk menggunakan paket ini, kamu harus terlebih dahulu [Menghubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk mendaftar. Kemudian, buat instance dan tugaskan ke paket tersebut. Semua workload yang dikirim ke QPU menggunakan paket ini akan dihitung terhadap langganan yang dialokasikan untukmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An administrator can set a usage limit on a Flex Plan instance that applies for the duration of the contract. If an instance has been marked as \"limited\" by your administrator (you will see a \"Remaining\" column in the usage area) and the instance exceeds its allocation (defined by your administrator), any active workload will continue running (including sessions) but pending workloads will remain in the queue until more time is available. If an instance is not limited and the instance exceeds its allocation, jobs run with that instance are likely to run at a lower priority and experience longer queue times.\n"
msgstr "Administrator bisa menetapkan batas penggunaan pada instance Flex Plan yang berlaku selama durasi kontrak. Jika sebuah instance telah ditandai sebagai \"limited\" oleh administratormu (kamu akan melihat kolom \"Remaining\" di area penggunaan) dan instance tersebut melebihi alokasinya (yang ditentukan oleh administratormu), workload yang sedang aktif akan terus berjalan (termasuk session) tetapi workload yang tertunda akan tetap berada di antrean hingga ada waktu yang tersedia. Jika sebuah instance tidak dibatasi dan melebihi alokasinya, job yang dijalankan dengan instance tersebut kemungkinan akan berjalan dengan prioritas lebih rendah dan mengalami waktu antrean yang lebih lama.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An alert displays on an instance's usage when it has exceeded its allocation.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah peringatan akan muncul pada penggunaan instance saat melebihi alokasinya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"premium-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"premium-plan\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan instance {#premium-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instance Premium Plan {#premium-plan-instance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Premium Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must first [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up. Then, create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads sent to QPUs by using this plan count toward your alloted subscription. \n"
msgstr "Premium Plan adalah paket berbayar. Untuk menggunakan paket ini, kamu harus terlebih dahulu [Menghubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk mendaftar. Kemudian, buat instance dan tugaskan ke paket tersebut. Semua workload yang dikirim ke QPU menggunakan paket ini akan dihitung terhadap langganan yang dialokasikan untukmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An administrator can set a usage limit on a Premium Plan instance that applies for the plan's 28-day rolling usage window.  If an instance has been marked as \"limited\" by your administrator (you will see a \"Remaining\" column in the usage area) and the instance exceeds its allocation (defined by your administrator), any active workload will continue running (including sessions) but pending workloads will remain in the queue until more time is available. If an instance is not limited and the instance exceeds its allocation, jobs run with that instance are likely to run at a lower priority and experience longer queue times.\n"
msgstr "Administrator bisa menetapkan batas penggunaan pada instance Premium Plan yang berlaku untuk jendela penggunaan bergulir 28 hari paket tersebut. Jika sebuah instance telah ditandai sebagai \"limited\" oleh administratormu (kamu akan melihat kolom \"Remaining\" di area penggunaan) dan instance tersebut melebihi alokasinya (yang ditentukan oleh administratormu), workload yang sedang aktif akan terus berjalan (termasuk session) tetapi workload yang tertunda akan tetap berada di antrean hingga ada waktu yang tersedia. Jika sebuah instance tidak dibatasi dan melebihi alokasinya, job yang dijalankan dengan instance tersebut kemungkinan akan berjalan dengan prioritas lebih rendah dan mengalami waktu antrean yang lebih lama.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"connect-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"connect-instance\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an instance in your code {#specify-an-instance-in-your-code}"
msgstr "Menentukan instance dalam kode-mu {#specify-an-instance-in-your-code}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the CRN or instance name to specify an instance to use - either when initializing the service, or when sending the workload to a QPU (for example, with [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend)). For instructions to specify an instance in your code, see [Initialize your account](/guides/initialize-account).\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan CRN atau nama instance untuk menentukan instance yang akan digunakan — baik saat menginisialisasi layanan, maupun saat mengirim workload ke QPU (misalnya, dengan [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend)). Untuk instruksi menentukan instance dalam kode-mu, lihat [Inisialisasi akun-mu](/guides/initialize-account).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When an instance is passed in, only backends and jobs from that instance are available (allowed in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.40.1 and later).\n"
msgstr "Ketika sebuah instance dimasukkan, hanya Backend dan job dari instance tersebut yang tersedia (diizinkan di `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.40.1 dan yang lebih baru).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an instance is not included when initializing the service, all backends and jobs across all instances in your account are available. In this case, when a backend is specified, an instance that can access the backend is found and used as described in [Automatically select the instance](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select).\n"
msgstr "Jika instance tidak disertakan saat menginisialisasi layanan, semua backend dan job di semua instance dalam akunmu akan tersedia. Dalam hal ini, saat backend ditentukan, instance yang bisa mengakses backend tersebut akan ditemukan dan digunakan seperti yang dijelaskan di [Pemilihan instance otomatis](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\" title=\"Required versions\">\n"
"Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 or later is required for the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\" title=\"Versi yang diperlukan\">\n"
"Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 atau yang lebih baru diperlukan untuk hal-hal berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the instance name to specify an instance\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan nama instance untuk menentukan instance\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Not passing in an instance\n"
msgstr "Tidak memasukkan instance\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting a preferred instance type and region\n"
msgstr "Mengatur tipe instance dan region yang diinginkan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For Qiskit Runtime v0.42 or later, free plans are prioritized by default when [automatic instance selection](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select) is used.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk Qiskit Runtime v0.42 atau yang lebih baru, paket gratis diprioritaskan secara default saat [pemilihan instance otomatis](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select) digunakan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"add-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"add-instance\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an instance {#create-an-instance}"
msgstr "Membuat instance {#create-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to create an instance and add it to your account. If you are an administrator who needs to set up Quantum Compute on Cloud for your organization, refer to [Plan Quantum Compute for an organization](/guides/considerations-set-up-runtime).\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah berikut untuk membuat instance dan menambahkannya ke akunmu. Jika kamu adalah administrator yang perlu menyiapkan Quantum Compute di Cloud untuk organisasimu, lihat [Merencanakan Quantum Compute untuk organisasi](/guides/considerations-set-up-runtime).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"switcher\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"switcher\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To add an instance to your account, first ensure you have the correct account and region selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menambahkan instance ke akunmu, pertama pastikan kamu telah memilih akun dan region yang benar di pemilih akun di header.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can have (or be part of) multiple IBM Cloud accounts.  If you don't see the instances or jobs you're expecting, try a different account.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa memiliki (atau menjadi bagian dari) beberapa akun IBM Cloud. Jika kamu tidak melihat instance atau job yang kamu harapkan, coba akun yang berbeda.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can access either region by using the same API key, but you can only see and access the instances that were created in the region that you're logged in to.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa mengakses salah satu region menggunakan API key yang sama, tetapi kamu hanya bisa melihat dan mengakses instance yang dibuat di region tempat kamu masuk.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to create an Open instance, you must choose the us-east region.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu ingin membuat instance Open, kamu harus memilih region us-east.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is immediately to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is immediately to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"
msgstr "        ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is immediately to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is immediately to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <span id=\"regions\"></span>\n"
msgstr "   <span id=\"regions\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"About regions\">\n"
"   The instance will be created in the selected region. This region determines these important characteristics:\n"
"     * Which QPUs are available.\n"
"     * Where the jobs' classical computation, such as compilation, takes place.\n"
"     * Where the user's workflow data remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"   <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Tentang region\">\n"
"   Instance akan dibuat di region yang dipilih. Region ini menentukan karakteristik penting berikut:\n"
"     * QPU mana yang tersedia.\n"
"     * Di mana komputasi klasik job, seperti kompilasi, berlangsung.\n"
"     * Di mana data workflow pengguna disimpan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    The workflow data includes the input circuits, circuit parameters, and quantum computation results.  It does not include metadata, such as number of shots, size of circuits, or other job statistics.\n"
msgstr "    Data workflow mencakup circuit input, parameter circuit, dan hasil komputasi kuantum. Ini tidak mencakup metadata, seperti jumlah shot, ukuran circuit, atau statistik job lainnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   To avoid exposure of the user's workflow data to a global Distributed Denial of Service protection layer, you can use [Virtual Private Endpoints](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-endpoints-support). `qiskit-ibm-runtime` supports this through the [`private_endpoint` parameter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service).\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"   Untuk menghindari paparan data workflow pengguna ke lapisan perlindungan Distributed Denial of Service global, kamu bisa menggunakan [Virtual Private Endpoints](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-endpoints-support). `qiskit-ibm-runtime` mendukung ini melalui [parameter `private_endpoint`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service).\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "From the dashboard Instances pane, click **View all**, or go to the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page from the main menu.\n"
msgstr "Dari panel Instances di dashboard, klik **View all**, atau buka halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) dari menu utama.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "From the Instances page, click **Create instance**.\n"
msgstr "Dari halaman Instances, klik **Create instance**.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a name and optionally add tags.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan nama dan secara opsional tambahkan tag.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have access to more than one resource group in IBM Cloud&reg;, you can choose to change the resource group this instance belongs to. See [Managing resource groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs&interface=ui) and [Giving access to resources in resource groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs_manage_access) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu memiliki akses ke lebih dari satu resource group di IBM Cloud&reg;, kamu bisa memilih untuk mengubah resource group tempat instance ini berada. Lihat [Managing resource groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs&interface=ui) dan [Giving access to resources in resource groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs_manage_access) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select the pricing plan this instance is associated with (for example, Pay-As-You-Go). Depending on the pricing plan selected, you can specify other options, such as the cost limit or the number of minutes to allocate to this instance. Note that if this instance is not associated with a free plan, a cost will be incurred when this instance is used to run workloads.\n"
msgstr "Pilih paket harga yang terkait dengan instance ini (misalnya, Pay-As-You-Go). Tergantung pada paket harga yang dipilih, kamu bisa menentukan opsi lain, seperti batas biaya atau jumlah menit yang dialokasikan untuk instance ini. Perlu diperhatikan bahwa jika instance ini tidak terkait dengan paket gratis, biaya akan dikenakan saat instance ini digunakan untuk menjalankan workload.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Next**. A list of the QPUs the instance can access is shown.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Next**. Daftar QPU yang bisa diakses instance ditampilkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want the instance to have access to all the QPUs listed (and all QPUs added to this plan in the future), click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu ingin instance memiliki akses ke semua QPU yang terdaftar (dan semua QPU yang ditambahkan ke paket ini di masa mendatang), klik **Next**.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    - If you are not setting up an open instance, you can customize which QPUs can be accessed with this instance. Click the \"Customize allocated compute resources\" toggle. Select specific QPUs that this instance can access, then click **Next**.\n"
"        <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      If you customize the allocated compute resources, the available QPUs will never be automatically updated, regardless of any changes made to the parent plan.  However, you can manually add or remove QPUs later. If you do not customize them, you will always have access to any QPU to which the account has access on the plan. So if in the future there is a new QPU added to the plan, the instance automatically has access to it.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"1. The Access group pane opens. A \"collaborators\" access group is automatically created for this instance. Users added to this access group can use the time allocated to this instance. You can [modify or create additional access groups](/guides/access-groups) by using the [IBM Cloud console](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). See [Setting up access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui) for instructions.\n"
"1. Click **Create instance**. You can now view the instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. If you have set up multiple plans on your account, each plan type has its own tab on the Instances table.\n"
msgstr ""
"    - Jika kamu tidak menyiapkan instance open, kamu bisa menyesuaikan QPU mana yang bisa diakses dengan instance ini. Klik toggle \"Customize allocated compute resources\". Pilih QPU tertentu yang bisa diakses oleh instance ini, lalu klik **Next**.\n"
"        <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Jika kamu menyesuaikan resource komputasi yang dialokasikan, QPU yang tersedia tidak akan pernah diperbarui secara otomatis, terlepas dari perubahan apa pun yang dilakukan pada paket induk. Namun, kamu bisa menambah atau menghapus QPU secara manual nantinya. Jika kamu tidak menyesuaikannya, kamu akan selalu memiliki akses ke QPU mana pun yang bisa diakses akun pada paket tersebut. Jadi jika di masa mendatang ada QPU baru yang ditambahkan ke paket, instance secara otomatis memiliki akses ke sana.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"1. Panel Access group terbuka. Grup akses \"collaborators\" secara otomatis dibuat untuk instance ini. Pengguna yang ditambahkan ke grup akses ini bisa menggunakan waktu yang dialokasikan untuk instance ini. Kamu bisa [memodifikasi atau membuat grup akses tambahan](/guides/access-groups) menggunakan [konsol IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). Lihat [Setting up access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui) untuk petunjuknya.\n"
"1. Klik **Create instance**. Kamu sekarang bisa melihat instance di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Jika kamu telah menyiapkan beberapa paket di akunmu, setiap jenis paket memiliki tab sendiri di tabel Instances.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pending workloads\">\n"
"The Pending workloads column on the Instances table shows the number of workloads currently queued in this instance across all QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pending workloads\">\n"
"Kolom Pending workloads di tabel Instances menampilkan jumlah workload yang saat ini diantrekan di instance ini di semua QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit an instance and its allocation {#edit-an-instance-and-its-allocation}"
msgstr "Mengedit instance dan alokasinya {#edit-an-instance-and-its-allocation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find the instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Click the overflow menu at the end the instance's row, and select Edit details.\n"
msgstr "Temukan instance di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Klik menu overflow di ujung baris instance tersebut, dan pilih Edit details.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Only administrators and owners can edit the instance.  See the [Create access policies and access groups](/guides/access-groups) guide for information about assigning access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Hanya administrator dan pemilik yang bisa mengedit instance. Lihat panduan [Membuat kebijakan akses dan grup akses](/guides/access-groups) untuk informasi tentang menetapkan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived instances {#archived-instances}"
msgstr "Instance yang diarsipkan {#archived-instances}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An archived instance is the result of one of the following scenarios.\n"
msgstr "Instance yang diarsipkan adalah hasil dari salah satu skenario berikut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "A privileged user has archived the account {#a-privileged-user-has-archived-the-account}"
msgstr "Pengguna dengan hak istimewa telah mengarsipkan akun {#a-privileged-user-has-archived-the-account}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A user with sufficient privileges for the account has archived the instance.\n"
"    - Any pending jobs in the instance are canceled.\n"
"    - Archived instances appear in a separate \"Archive\" section on the Instances page.\n"
"    - Jobs can still be retrieved.\n"
"    - Users cannot submit new jobs to the archived instance.\n"
"    - The archived instance does not count against your plan's allocation.\n"
"    - A user with sufficient privileges can reactivate an instance that they (or another privileged user) archived at any time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna dengan hak istimewa yang cukup untuk akun tersebut telah mengarsipkan instance.\n"
"    - Semua job yang tertunda di instance dibatalkan.\n"
"    - Instance yang diarsipkan muncul di bagian \"Archive\" terpisah pada halaman Instances.\n"
"    - Job masih bisa diambil.\n"
"    - Pengguna tidak bisa mengirimkan job baru ke instance yang diarsipkan.\n"
"    - Instance yang diarsipkan tidak dihitung terhadap alokasi paketmu.\n"
"    - Pengguna dengan hak istimewa yang cukup bisa mengaktifkan kembali instance yang mereka (atau pengguna lain dengan hak istimewa) arsipkan kapan saja.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To archive an instance you manage, go to the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. At the end of the row for that instance, click the three-dot overflow menu on the right, then select *Archive instance*.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengarsipkan instance yang kamu kelola, buka halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Di ujung baris untuk instance tersebut, klik menu overflow tiga titik di sebelah kanan, lalu pilih *Archive instance*.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account no longer has access to the instance's plan {#account-no-longer-has-access-to-the-instances-plan}"
msgstr "Akun tidak lagi memiliki akses ke paket instance {#account-no-longer-has-access-to-the-instances-plan}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The account no longer has access to the plan under which the instance was created.\n"
msgstr "Akun tidak lagi memiliki akses ke paket tempat instance dibuat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived instances appear in a separate \"Archive\" section on the Instances page.\n"
msgstr "Instance yang diarsipkan muncul di bagian \"Archive\" terpisah pada halaman Instances.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs can still be retrieved.\n"
msgstr "Job masih bisa diambil.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users cannot submit new jobs to the archived instance.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna tidak bisa mengirimkan job baru ke instance yang diarsipkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The archived instance does not count against your plan's allocation.\n"
msgstr "Instance yang diarsipkan tidak dihitung terhadap alokasi paketmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instances that have been archived because they no longer have visibility into the instance's plan can't be reactivated.\n"
msgstr "Instance yang telah diarsipkan karena tidak lagi memiliki visibilitas ke paket instance tidak bisa diaktifkan kembali.\n"

